3. Trademarks & Branding
------------------------------------------------------------------------

Neither `GPL-3.0-only` nor `CERN-OHL-S-2.0` grants permission to use the
project names ("Plant Monitor", "plant-esp32"), logos, icons, or other
branding to market third-party hardware or services or to imply official
endorsement. Third-party builds and commercial products distributed under
the open-source licenses must use distinct branding while retaining
required attribution notices (e.g. "Based on plant-esp32 by Robert
Longbottom").

